<!-- Debug-only overrides. This source set is merged over main for the debug
     build type only, so the release APK is completely unaffected.

     Why this exists: debug now installs as com.edgemetals.loads.debug and sits
     on the phone NEXT TO the real app (see app/build.gradle). Two identical
     "Edge Yard" icons with no way to tell them apart is how you end up testing
     against the wrong one. -->
